----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  [canonical, baryonic TF] field relation slope 0.193 on N = 90 distance-matched field galaxies; Virgo median residual +0.0298 dex vs field -0.0048
  [canonical, baryonic TF] predicted suppression: median -0.0089 dex, 5-95% [-0.1504, -0.0003]
